    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d288">

                <pb facs="0711" n="683" xml:id="pg683"/>

                <head>288. Memorandum From the President’s Special Assistant (Rostow) to President
                        Johnson<anchor n="1" xml:id="d288-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1968-08-20T18:55:00-04:00">August 20, 1968, 6:55 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Mr. President:</p>
                <p>Attached are the notes for the background briefing, which I have prepared for
                    Sec. Rusk and me for tomorrow.</p>
                <p>I await your guidance.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">W. W. Rostow</hi>
                        <anchor n="2" xml:id="d288-f2"/>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d288-a1.xml" xpointer="d288-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
